时，施放重击或闪避反击后可触发风袭，造成气动伤害。\n \n空中攻击·释羽\n当秧秧持有3声【流响】时，在空中使用普攻，将消耗所有【流响】，发动连续攻击，并自空中俯冲造成气动伤害。落地后，秧秧将收刀攻击，造成气动伤害，此次伤害为普攻伤害。\n \n流响获取规则\n【流响】上限3声。\n第4段普攻命中目标时，获取1声【流响】。\n重击风吟命中目标时，获取1声【流响】。\n共鸣技能流风载域命中目标时，获取1声【流响】。\n施放变奏技能湛蓝礼赞时，获取1声【流响】。","descEn":"Heavy Attack: Stormy Strike\nWhen Yangyang has 3 Melodies, she can cast Stormy Strike after Heavy Attack or Dodge Counter, dealing Aero DMG.\n \nMid-air Attack: Feather Release\nWhen Yangyang has 3 Melodies, cast Basic Attack in mid-air to consume all Melodies and perform consecutive strikes, diving from mid-air, dealing Aero DMG. As Yangyang lands, she sheathes her sword with an attack, dealing Aero DMG, considered as Basic Attack DMG.\n \nMelody\nYangyang can hold up to 3 Melodies\nYangyang obtains 1 Melody with every Basic Attack 4 on hit.\nYangyang obtains 1 Melody for every Heavy Attack Zephyr Song on hit.\nYangyang obtains 1 Melody for every Resonance Skill Zephyr Domain on hit.\nYangyang obtains 1 Melody upon casting Intro Skill Cerulean Song.","params":[{"label":"风袭伤害","labelEn":"Stormy Strike Damage","values":["19.12%*2","20.69%*2","22.26%*2","24.45%*2","26.02%*2","27.82%*2","30.33%*2","32.84%*2","35.35%*2","38.02%*2"]},{"label":"释羽伤害","labelEn":"Feather Release Damage","values":["10.93%*5+63.78%*2","11.83%*5+69.01%*2","12.72%*5+74.24%*2","13.98%*5+81.57%*2","14.88%*5+86.80%*2","15.91%*5+92.81%*2","17.34%*5+101.18%*2","18.78%*5+109.55%*2","20.21%*5+117.92%*2","21.73%*5+126.81%*2"]},{"label":"释羽回复协奏能量","labelEn":"Feather Release Concerto Regen","values":["30","30","30","30","30","30","30","30","30","30"]}],"hits":[{"label":"风袭伤害","labelEn":"Stormy Strike Damage","term":0,"count":2,"multiplier":[0.1912,0.2069,0.2226,0.2445,0.2602,0.2782,0.3033,0.3284,0.3535,0.3802],"damageId":1402203001,"type":"heavy","typeId":1,"typeName":"重击","calc":"damage","element":"aero","elementId":4,"scaling":"atk","rateField":"RateLv","flat":null,"energy":[0.63],"concerto":[2.04],"elementPowerType":4,"toughness":[0.255],"offTune":[0.204],"hardn